From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seth Forshee <seth.forshee@canonical.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2020 11:09:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: selftests/net -- disable timeout

Some of our net selftests are timing out in autopkgtest. These
tests pass when run in a different (presumably faster)
environment. It appears that we can't disable the timeout for
individual test cases, so disable the timeout for the net
selftests globally.

Signed-off-by: Seth Forshee <seth.forshee@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00042
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@8e00655e7b3093495688b4c9c201146f6ff82230
---
 tools/testing/selftests/net/settings | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/testing/selftests/net/settings b/tools/testing/selftests/net/settings
index ed8418e8217a..e7b9417537fb 100644
--- a/tools/testing/selftests/net/settings
+++ b/tools/testing/selftests/net/settings
@@ -1 +1 @@
-timeout=3600
+timeout=0
